          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "कपडे (kapḍe) is the plural of kapḍā, \"cloth\", which goes back, like Marathi kāpaḍ, \"cloth\", to Sanskrit karpaṭa, \"patched garment, rag\" (CDIAL 2871). CDIAL reports Przyluski's view that the Sanskrit word comes from Austroasiatic."
